WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.340
How much does this cost,
or how much is your service?

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:05.560
We don't have a one shoe fits all,
and that's why we get the results that we do.

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:10.560
But you won't pay less than five hundred dollars,
and you won't pay more than five thousand dollars.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:15.000
There is a package that's tailored for each individual,
depending where they are and where they want to go.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.640
That's a very personalised plan specifically made just
for you. Hence why this call is important.
